venv/
.cache/
**/.DS_Store
**/__pycache__/
# Claude artifacts
RELEASE-NOTES.md
session-log.md

# Clawd overlay sprites — AGPL-3.0 upstream, fetched at setup, never vendored
# (scripts/fetch-clawd-assets.sh). Committing them would spread copyleft.
/assets/clawd/

# Un-ignore planning files so git-crypt can track them (overrides global gitignore)
!TODOS.md
!.memory/SESSION-LOG.md
# .memory/ARCHIVE-LOG.md stays machine-local (large, low sync value)
/.memory/ARCHIVE-LOG.md
!.work/FINDINGS.md
!.work/PROGRESS.md
!.work/PLAN.md
# Fable-mode runtime marker + method scratch — local per-project state, never committed
# (committing .fable-active would turn fable-mode ON for anyone who clones).
/.work/.fable-active
/.work/GATES.md
